  message: "Bulk-verify 2026-07-17: premise CONFIRMED still valid but purely cosmetic (P4 right). The 5 pass_ids still lack '-linker' (decorator_dispatch.py:48, di_resolution.py:64, inherited_calls.py:122, method_call_recovery.py:73, type_hierarchy.py:55); the other 51 linkers carry it. BUT nothing enforces or depends on the suffix -- no validator (catalog checks registration only), no production consumer keys on '-linker' (grep endswith('-linker') empty); the stated rationale (consumers substring-match) is unimplemented. Fix = ~10 producer lines (align @register_linker name + PASS_ID) + ~4 exact-match test-assertion updates (test_linker_di_resolution.py:960, test_type_hierarchy_linker.py:863/970/972); catalog + substring checks follow automatically. COST: changes user-visible origin strings (Symbol.origin/Edge.origin/AnalysisRun.pass_id) + hypergumbo explain output + invalidates cached artifacts for these 5. DEFERRED pending owner do/defer (uniformity vs churn); if done, add a test enforcing the convention so it can't re-drift."  # 2d8d
